{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary\nchanges.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-46569",
    "CVE-2026-56135",
    "CVE-2026-46570",
    "CVE-2026-46571",
    "CVE-2026-46572",
    "CVE-2026-42617",
